# Unit calls of two collision tests no code refers to, in level 4 (stage
# a1 s0) on Aladdin's record (M and X 8-bit, DB $80), the view's y
# ($1777) set to $0060 so his points are on the view, the machine put back
# after each. Tiles read from the level's map in a WRAM dump; his probe 4
# is 5 across and 2 up, probe 8 5 across and 16 up.
# ActorGroundCountLong (81:B729, by JSL into ActorGroundCount 81:B72D):
# at x, y ($08E7, $08EA) $0440, $00D0 both points of probe 8 ($043B and
# $0445, $00C0) are in solid tiles, so both counts are taken.
# ActorOutOfWallsMovePlayer (81:B575): at $0440, $00D8 facing right
# ($08EF 0), probe 4 ($0445, $00D6) is in an empty tile and probe 8
# ($0445, $00C8) in a solid one, so the actor is moved out of it and the
# player's x by as much.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a1_s0.state
wait 5
set $001777 60,00
set $0008E7 40,04
set $0008EA D0,00
call 81B729 long d=08DB db=80 p=30
set $001777 60,00
set $0008E7 40,04
set $0008EA D8,00
set $0008EF 00
call 81B575 long d=08DB db=80 p=30
